<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>AIS3 on 学的斜槓日記</title><link>https://manabu7696.github.io/tags/ais3/</link><description>Recent content in AIS3 on 学的斜槓日記</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 19 Aug 2024 20:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://manabu7696.github.io/tags/ais3/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>AIS3 2024 pre-exam write-up</title><link>https://manabu7696.github.io/p/ais3_2024_pre-exam_writeup/</link><pubDate>Mon, 19 Aug 2024 20:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://manabu7696.github.io/p/ais3_2024_pre-exam_writeup/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://i.ibb.co/zVdmNbq9/page.png" alt="Featured image of post AIS3 2024 pre-exam write-up" /&gt;&lt;h2 id="welcome"&gt;Welcome&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Welcome題目敘述" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="410px" data-flex-grow="171" height="596" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://i.ibb.co/4ZcdwYZQ/welcome.png" srcset="https://manabu7696.github.io/welcome_13103722033858916578_hu_36b004e7b5cff0e8.png 800w, https://i.ibb.co/4ZcdwYZQ/welcome.png 1020w" width="1020"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;flag即在題目敘述中&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="three-dimensional-secret"&gt;Three Dimensional Secret&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;將檔案下載下來解壓縮可以發現是wireshark的檔案&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;可以發現主要的通訊是TCP協議，利用follow功能可以看到傳輸了什麼東西&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;由傳輸內容可以發現是使用Cura生成的gcode&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;將其內容寫入一個新檔案並將其副檔名設為.gcode&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在cura import這個檔案即可獲得flag&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="emoji-console"&gt;Emoji Console&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;利用cat及萬用字元可以發現目錄下有一個叫flag的目錄及拿到python源代碼，同時可以知道各種表情符號所代表的文字&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="cat *" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="589px" data-flex-grow="245" height="726" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://i.ibb.co/gLdXTZGD/command1.png" srcset="https://manabu7696.github.io/command1_18410139422755547191_hu_dd45c84b3f74e663.png 800w, https://manabu7696.github.io/command1_18410139422755547191_hu_ce52cba0e17fd4b3.png 1600w, https://i.ibb.co/gLdXTZGD/command1.png 1783w" width="1783"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;構建如下指令後可以發現，flag下有個可以讀flag的python檔&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="cd flag;pip:|cat *" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="579px" data-flex-grow="241" height="735" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://i.ibb.co/vCrns1jY/command2.png" srcset="https://manabu7696.github.io/command2_10492637402288102386_hu_f77c036878420694.png 800w, https://manabu7696.github.io/command2_10492637402288102386_hu_8ff9b6c06caedc1e.png 1600w, https://i.ibb.co/vCrns1jY/command2.png 1776w" width="1776"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;因此利用以下指令即可讀到flag&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="cd flag;pip:|python *" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="595px" data-flex-grow="247" height="722" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://i.ibb.co/k6PtMkHs/command3.png" srcset="https://manabu7696.github.io/command3_13744559093517925495_hu_3d57556e55ce55a8.png 800w, https://manabu7696.github.io/command3_13744559093517925495_hu_d9b3e2121c8e770b.png 1600w, https://i.ibb.co/k6PtMkHs/command3.png 1790w" width="1790"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;</description></item></channel></rss>